From 00dd74af9b5e3875c5f2a9c53a84e4f09d0e3649 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 21:38:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] base: add a window model for exhibition (dock) mode windows

Exhibition mode - what a device shows while it sits in a charging dock -
hosts an application full screen, apart from the ordinary card stack.
Give those windows a type of their own, _WEBOS_WINDOW_TYPE_DOCK, and a
model to match the ones already here for popup, keyboard, system UI and
overlay windows, so a shell can pick them up without having to filter
cards by hand.
Upstream-Status: Pending

---
 .../models/DockWindowModel.qml                | 33 +++++++++++++++++++
 base/qml/WebOSCompositorBase/qmldir           |  1 +
 2 files changed, 34 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 base/qml/WebOSCompositorBase/models/DockWindowModel.qml

